Audited 24 whole Gaussian intrinsic concentration theorem declarations; only the permitted three axioms.
The actual polyhedral layer under arbitrary measurable independent shift is bounded by min 1 ((2*s/v)*E faceProjectionNorm), and by 4*min 1 (s*sqrt(log(em)/v)). No shift moments, rank condition, or distinct-row premise is present.
